6. Pseudocode

BEGIN
INPUT consultation, diagnosis, treatment charges
CALCULATE total bill
IF total bill > 5000, apply 10% concession
CALCULATE final bill
IF final bill <= 3000, classify as Low
ELSE IF final bill <= 7000, classify as Medium
ELSE classify as High
DISPLAY final bill and classification
END

7. Python Source Code

c = float(input("Consultation charge: "))
d = float(input("Diagnostic charge: "))
t = float(input("Treatment charge: "))
b = c + d + t
if b > 5000: b *= 0.90
print("Final Bill:", b)
print("Category:", "Low" if b <= 3000 else "Medium" if b <= 7000 else "High")

